{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47012","headline":"读李贺歌集 · 齐己","name":"读李贺歌集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤水无精华，荆山亦枯槁。\n玄珠与虹玉，璨璨李贺抱。\n清晨醉起临春台，吴绫蜀锦胸襟开。\n狂多两手掀蓬莱，珊瑚掇尽空土堆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47012.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47012","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}